 <h3><u>ya bunayya</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><big>aayi makhtal me shaame gharibaan<br>baap ko dhundti hai sakina<br><br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br>de raha hai sada sheh ka laasha<br><br>kamsini me yatimi mili hai <br>aag sine me gham ki lagi hai<br>kitni raaton se soyi nahi hai<br>aake baba ke sine pe soja <br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br><br>chaar su hain laeenon ka lashkar<br>haaye us par andhera sitamgar<br>kyun nikal aayi khaime se baahar<br>kaun dega tujhe ab sahaara<br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br><br>haay subhe dahum shaame ghurbat<br>tujh pe tuti balaa ki musibat<br>she rahi ho hamaari bhi furqat<br>sun ke baba ka nauha chali aa<br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br><br>le gaya hai laeen goshwaare <br>zaalimon ne tamaache bhi maare<br>jal chuke saare khaime tumhaare<br>tute dil ko milega dilaasa<br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br><br>mere sine ki aadat pari hai<br>khaak par nind aayegi kaise<br>zakhm tujhko kahaan sone denge<br>tera bistar hai baba ka sina <br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br><br>jaabajaa ran me laashen hain beta<br>khauf khaawo agar ay hazina<br>bhayya akbar ko aawaaz dena<br>kehna akbar bulaate hain baba<br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br><br>baba baba jo kehti chali ho<br>mere laashe ko tum dhundti ho<br>meri chaahat ko tarsi huwi ho<br>tere gham se tarapta hai baba<br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br><br>chur zakhmon se laasha mera hai<br>sina tiron se mera bhara hai<br>laashe besar ki phir bhi sada hai<br>mere pehlu me soja sakina<br>ya bunayya elayya elayya<br><br>haaye irfan o mazhar wo manzar<br>mil gayi baap ki laashe besar<br>royi laashe se batchi lipat kar<br>us ghari sheh ka laasha pukaara <br>soja soja ay meri sakina</big></p> 
